        0,
        17.48
      ],
      "quote": [
        {
          "at": 0.98,
          "end": 3,
          "text": "Lined up for her second hold.\n准备争取第二次保发。"
        },
        {
          "at": 13.76,
          "end": 17.06,
          "text": "Well, if it's worrying, she's moving pretty well today already.\n即便有些担忧，她今天的移动已经相当不错。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "wsc-13-00",
      "path": "/workspace/scratch/sabalenka-exit-6m4jt6/source-audio/foreground-wsc-13-00.json",
      "sha256": "fd9e3764649eecfcc2e9d94f5c06fc91a81d4f3853c181f1ceae0746803eeacb",
      "window": [
        0,
        14.96
      ],
      "quote": []
    },
    {
      "source": "wsc-17-00",
      "path": "/workspace/scratch/sabalenka-exit-6m4jt6/source-audio/foreground-wsc-17-00.json",
      "sha256": "d093cafee8e715bb89bf7fdf080c7e41b33552f06a8d6288ee5bb1312030d99f",
      "window": [
        0,
        16.48
      ],
      "quote": [
        {
          "at": 0,
          "end": 3.02,
          "text": "Of course, four games on the trot means she broke twice as well.\n当然，连赢四局也意味着她两次破发。"
        },
        {
          "at": 3.02,
          "end": 6.06,
          "text": "And Sabalenka has to reclaim her focus.\n萨巴伦卡必须重新集中注意力。"
        },
        {
          "at": 10.78,
          "end": 14.82,
          "text": "You can see already on the opening point, Ann Li rejuvenated.\n从开场这一分就能看出，李吉妮重振了精神。"
        },
        {
          "at": 14.82,
          "end": 16.22,
          "text": "She's starting to feel her game.\n她开始找回自己的比赛感觉。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "wsc-20-00",
      "path": "/workspace/scratch/sabalenka-exit-6m4jt6/source-audio/foreground-wsc-20-00.json",
      "sha256": "f1f0fb5032b5c393c7faa773fb2112e9693ba410af2be26d6ceef1cece32c58b",
      "window": [
        0,
        12.68
      ],
      "quote": []
    },
    {
      "source": "wsc-22-00",
      "path": "/workspace/scratch/sabalenka-exit-6m4jt6/source-audio/foreground-wsc-22-00.json",
      "sha256": "8411385578ce0c6e73086e3a06457c053fe1242be61f6ae96988089fb70baefc",
      "window": [
        0,
        17.6
      ],
      "quote": [
        {
          "at": 0,
          "end": 1.72,
          "text": "She needs one big time here.\n这时她迫切需要一记好发球。"
        },
        {
          "at": 10.52,
          "end": 13.74,
          "text": "Now she got that first serve in, but it didn't do her any good.\n这次一发进了，但仍未能帮她拿下这一分。"
        },
        {
          "at": 14.16,
          "end": 15.56,
          "text": "Sabalenka is back in the mix.\n萨巴伦卡重新回到争夺之中。"
        },
        {
          "at": 16.14,
          "end": 16.98,
          "text": "She's fired up.\n她的斗志燃起来了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "wsc-24-00",
      "path": "/workspace/scratch/sabalenka-exit-6m4jt6/source-audio/foreground-wsc-24-00.json",
