      "quote": []
    },
    {
      "source": "wsc-29-00",
      "path": "/workspace/scratch/sabalenka-exit-6m4jt6/source-audio/foreground-wsc-29-00.json",
      "sha256": "156047cd75a74cb23c4744dbca7ed8c063e09be39c5478e73e6ff13c51e4d45d",
      "window": [
        0,
        44.44
      ],
      "quote": [
        {
          "at": 6.62,
          "end": 11.02,
          "text": "And a tournament that has already produced headlines in its opening three days,\n这项赛事开赛三天，已经不断制造头条。"
        },
        {
          "at": 11.02,
          "end": 13.92,
          "text": "Ann Li produces the biggest of them all,\n如今李吉妮制造了其中最大的一个。"
        },
        {
          "at": 13.92,
          "end": 17.0,
          "text": "in all capital letters above the fold.\n足以成为头版醒目的大标题。"
        },
        {
          "at": 19.46,
          "end": 24.2,
          "text": "Three-time champion in Wuhan, Aryna Sabalenka loses her opening match\n武汉三届冠军萨巴伦卡首场比赛就出局了。"
        },
        {
          "at": 24.2,
          "end": 26.4,
          "text": "at the hands of the world number 30,\n她输给了世界排名第三十的选手。"
        },
        {
          "at": 26.4,
          "end": 29.88,
          "text": "for the biggest win in Ann Li's career.\n这是李吉妮职业生涯最重要的一场胜利。"
        },
        {
          "at": 35.1,
          "end": 38.5,
          "text": "Sabalenka handed just her second loss at the Wuhan Open,\n萨巴伦卡遭遇个人武汉公开赛第二场失利。"
        },
        {
          "at": 38.5,
          "end": 42.46,
          "text": "as Ann Li comes through needing ten match points to get it done,\n李吉妮直到第十个赛点才终于锁定胜利。"
        },
        {
          "at": 42.46,
          "end": 44.24,
          "text": "7-6 in the third.\n决胜盘七比六。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
